slot. on RG EDC
===============

slot. is a cartridge-shelf frontend for Game Boy, Game Boy Color and Game Boy
Advance, built here from https://github.com/slot-cfw/slot and distributed
under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (see LICENSE).

- slot. by Brandon Kowalski (https://github.com/BrandonKowalski/slot,
  https://slot-cfw.fyi).
- Cartridge, board and shelf artwork by Markus
  (https://github.com/MarkusMaribu), shipped in slot.'s repository.
- slot. for Android by Baggio94 (https://github.com/Baggio94/slot-for-android)
  inspired its support for square screens such as the Anbernic RG Rotate.
- Emulation cores: mGBA, gpSP and Gambatte (see their licence files here).

RG EDC carries small patches for the RG Rotate (square 720x720 game view,
OpenGL ES context, PipeWire audio buffering). They are in the RG EDC source
tree under projects/ROCKNIX/packages/apps/slot/patches and are distributed
under the same GPL-3.0-or-later licence.
